From: Craig Johnson <1545411+captainpacket@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 10:58:32 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] kubevirt: Huawei VRP VMs get a serial-console bootstrap
 (ConfigPush): sysname, mgmt, user, SSH

---
